{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A brief connector page for thoughtful, integrative care — plan a session and map what to bring." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbf8;--ink:#13221f;--muted:#556;--accent:#7aa887;--accent-2:#b48e6d;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --max-width:980px;--radius:14px;--gap:20px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--bg), #f2f6f2 60%);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;}
    header{padding:28px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a.active{background:var(--glass);color:var(--ink)}

    /* Diagonal split hero */
    .hero-wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:18px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px;align-items:stretch}
    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(10,10,10,0.06)}
    .intro{font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink)}
    .tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(122,168,135,0.12);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}

    /* decorative diagonal */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-6%;top:-10%;width:56%;height:140%;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12;}

    /* split content */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.4));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:24px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Session planner */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"], textarea, select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(15,20,18,0.06);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:90px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(19,34,31,0.06);color:var(--ink)}

    /* Inventory */
    .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}
    .check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
    .check input{margin-top:4px}

    /* outputs */
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;background:#fbfff9;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(15,20,18,0.06);font-size:13px}
    .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:30px auto;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:20px}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero-split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Symptoms</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="active">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero-wrap">
      <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 600 800" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#b8d9c2" stop-opacity="0.9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f0d8c0" stop-opacity="0.9"/></linearGradient>
          <pattern id="p1" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="60" height="60" patternTransform="rotate(15)">
            <rect width="60" height="60" fill="url(#g1)"/>
            <path d="M0 30 L60 30" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity="0.06" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="4" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.04"/>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)"></rect>
      </svg>

      <div class="hero-split">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="tag">Connect • Prepare • Focus</div>
          <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Bring what matters to the first conversation</h1>
          <p class="lead">Use the planner below to sketch a session frame, and try the inventory to shape a focused consultation agenda. Save or copy a concise summary to bring to your appointment.</p>
          <p class="meta" style="margin-top:12px">Prefer speaking? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Quick link</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
            <a class="btn ghost" href="book.html">Plan a visit</a>
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — sessions by video or in-person.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="grid" style="max-width:var(--max-width);margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px;">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Session Planner</h2>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)">Build a practical first-session outline and export a plaintext summary to copy into messages or your notes.</p>

          <form id="planner">
            <label for="goal">Primary goal for this series</label>
            <input id="goal" name="goal" type="text" placeholder="e.g., calm evening anxiety, stabilize energy, manage chronic tension" />

            <div class="row">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="length">Session length</label>
                <select id="length" name="length">
                  <option>50 minutes (standard)</option>
                  <option>25 minutes (brief)</option>
                  <option>80 minutes (comprehensive)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="width:160px">
                <label for="frequency">Frequency</label>
                <select id="frequency" name="frequency">
                  <option>Weekly</option>
                  <option>Biweekly</option>
                  <option>Monthly</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label>Modalities to consider</label>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Nutrition"/> Nutrition</label>
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Sleep"/> Sleep
              </label>
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Movement"/> Movement</label>
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Mind-Body"/> Mind-Body
              </label>
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Supplements"/> Supplements</label>
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" name="mod" value="Environmental"/> Environment</label>
            </div>

            <label for="notes">Key notes to share with the clinician</label>
            <textarea id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Brief context, previous treatments, medication, important preferences..."></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;align-items:center">
              <button type="button" id="buildBtn" class="btn">Create summary</button>
              <button type="button" id="clearPlanner" class="btn ghost">Reset</button>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="meta">Summary preview</div>
              <div id="plannerOutput" class="output" aria-live="polite">Start a plan to see a plaintext summary.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
                <button type="button" id="copyPlanner" class="btn">Copy summary</button>
                <button type="button" id="downloadPlanner" class="btn ghost">Download .txt</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Whole-person inventory</h2>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)">Tick the areas you want to review. The page will propose a focused consultation agenda and a follow-up cadence tailored to how many areas you pick.</p>

          <div class="checks" id="inventory">
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep"/>Sleep</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Nutrition"/>Nutrition
            </label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Movement"/>Movement</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Stress"/>Stress & Rhythm</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Mood"/>Mood & Emotions</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Relationships"/>Relationships</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Work"/>Work & Focus</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Environment"/>Environment</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Digestive"/>Digestive Health</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="Mindfulness"/>Mindfulness & Practices</label>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
            <button id="generateAgenda" class="btn">Generate agenda & cadence</button>
            <button id="clearInventory" class="btn ghost">Clear</button>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="meta">Consultation agenda</div>
            <div id="agendaOutput" class="output">Mark areas and press "Generate" to get a tailored agenda.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px" class="meta">Suggested follow-up cadence</div>
            <div id="cadenceOutput" class="output">—</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button id="copyAgenda" class="btn">Copy agenda</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">What to bring</h3>
          <ul style="margin:0;color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px">
            <li>Any recent labs or consult notes (optional)</li>
            <li>A short list of priorities or worries</li>
            <li>Medications & supplements list</li>
            <li>Questions about logistics or billing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Practical notes</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">This site helps you prepare. Clinical assessment is individualized; the planner is an aide to conversation, not a diagnosis. For urgent medical issues, seek immediate care.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:stretch">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer direct contact</div>
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="btn">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
          <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="btn ghost">Email {{EMAIL}}</a>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding:8px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — thoughtful integrative support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. For emergencies, contact local services. <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Planner logic
    function getCheckedValues(name){
      const els = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="mod"]:checked');
      return Array.from(els).map(e=>e.value);
    }

    function buildSummary(){
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value.trim() || 'No primary goal entered';
      const length = document.getElementById('length').value;
      const freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
      const mods = getCheckedValues('mod');
      const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim() || '(no extra notes)';

      const lines = [];
      lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session plan');
      lines.push('Primary goal: ' + goal);
      lines.push('Session length: ' + length + ' | ' + 'Frequency: ' + freq);
      lines.push('Consider modalities: ' + (mods.length? mods.join(', '): 'None selected'));
      lines.push('Notes: ' + notes);
      lines.push('Prepared: ' + new Date().toLocaleString());

      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const text = buildSummary();
      document.getElementById('plannerOutput').textContent = text;
    });

    document.getElementById('clearPlanner').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.getElementById('planner').reset();
      document.getElementById('plannerOutput').textContent = 'Start a plan to see a plaintext summary.';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlanner').addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      const txt = document.getElementById('plannerOutput').textContent;
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt); alert('Summary copied to clipboard'); }catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually'); }
    });

    document.getElementById('downloadPlanner').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const txt = document.getElementById('plannerOutput').textContent;
      const blob = new Blob([txt],{type:'text/plain'});
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = url; a.download = 'session-plan.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove();
      URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Inventory -> Agenda & Cadence
    function inventoryItems(){
      const checks = document.querySelectorAll('#inventory input[type="checkbox"]');
      return Array.from(checks).filter(c=>c.checked).map(c=>c.value);
    }

    function generateAgenda(){
      const items = inventoryItems();
      if(items.length===0){
        return {agenda: 'No areas selected. Mark areas you want to review to create an agenda.', cadence: 'No cadence suggested.'};
      }
      // Prioritize: first three are primary topics
      const primary = items.slice(0,3);
      const secondary = items.slice(3);
      const agendaLines = [];
      agendaLines.push('Consultation agenda — ' + new Date().toLocaleDateString());
      agendaLines.push('Total areas: ' + items.length);
      agendaLines.push('Opening (5–10 min): brief check-in and main concern');
      agendaLines.push('Primary topics:');
      primary.forEach((it,i)=>{ agendaLines.push((i+1)+'. ' + it + ' — 12–18 min (history, key measures, one immediate step)'); });
      if(secondary.length){
        agendaLines.push('Secondary topics:');
        secondary.forEach((it,i)=>{ agendaLines.push('- ' + it + ' — 4–8 min (screen/plan)'); });
      }
      agendaLines.push('Wrap: refine 2–3 action steps and any small tracking items');

      // cadence rules
      let cadence = '';
      if(items.length<=2){ cadence = 'Follow-up: 2–4 weeks for progress check. If symptom-focused, consider 1–2 week check-ins for medication or acute changes.'; }
      else if(items.length<=5){ cadence = 'Follow-up: 1–3 weeks initially, then 4–6 week spacing as steps stabilize. Use brief check-ins between visits for tracking.'; }
      else { cadence = 'Follow-up: Start with weekly or biweekly touchpoints for 6–8 weeks while priorities are addressed, then extend to monthly maintenance as items stabilize.'; }

      // build short plan of measurements
      const measures = items.map(it=> '- Track: ' + it + ' (one metric or symptom to monitor)').join('\n');
      agendaLines.push('Suggested measures:\n' + measures);

      return {agenda: agendaLines.join('\n'), cadence: cadence};
    }

    document.getElementById('generateAgenda').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const out = generateAgenda();
      document.getElementById('agendaOutput').textContent = out.agenda;
      document.getElementById('cadenceOutput').textContent = out.cadence;
    });

    document.getElementById('clearInventory').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.querySelectorAll('#inventory input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(c=>c.checked=false);
      document.getElementById('agendaOutput').textContent = 'Mark areas and press "Generate" to get a tailored agenda.';
      document.getElementById('cadenceOutput').textContent = '—';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyAgenda').addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      const agenda = document.getElementById('agendaOutput').textContent;
      const cadence = document.getElementById('cadenceOutput').textContent;
      const text = agenda + '\n\nFollow-up cadence:\n' + cadence + '\n\nPrepared by: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}';
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert('Agenda copied to clipboard'); }catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually'); }
    });

    // Simple accessibility: allow Enter on checkboxes to toggle
    document.querySelectorAll('#inventory input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(cb=>{
      cb.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); cb.checked=!cb.checked; }});
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the holistic_medicine site (chunk 4).

Files included:
- contact.html — the Connect page with two local interactive tools: Session Planner and Whole-person Inventory.

What the page does:
- Session Planner: lets a visitor enter a primary goal, select session length and frequency, choose modalities, and add brief notes. "Create summary" builds a plaintext plan suitable to copy or download as .txt.
- Whole-person Inventory: a checklist of life areas produces a suggested consultation agenda and a follow-up cadence algorithmically based on how many areas are selected. Both agenda and cadence can be copied to clipboard.

Placeholders used (replace in final build):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}  - practice name
- {{TAGLINE}}        - short tagline
- {{PHONE}}          - phone number
- {{EMAIL}}          - contact email
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} - primary CTA label text
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}   - primary CTA URL
- {{CITY}}           - city
- {{STATE}}          - state

Notes for integrators:
- The page references an inline SVG pattern; the project also expects a local decorative asset at assets/img/pattern.svg in the full bundle if you prefer an external file.
- All interactive code is local JS inside contact.html; no external libraries required.
- The content and CTAs are intentionally minimal and poetic; adjust copy to match your clinic voice while keeping clinical disclaimers where appropriate.

Seed: 135348715
Layout family: split_diagonal
Voice family: minimal_poetic
Offer model: hybrid
Section pack: hero,gallery,what_to_expect,objections,cta

Copyright: template for integrative/holistic medicine. No medical guarantees; the tools are preparatory for clinical conversation."}
BUNDLE_END
